; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Falling Snow
; CATEGORY: Animation & Many Turtles
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     many turtles, TELL, EACH, SETSHAPE, animation, random
; SUMMARY:  Twenty star shaped turtles drift down like snowflakes and slowly build a snowdrift.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   Every snowflake is its own turtle, wearing the star shape. Each
;   one falls at its own speed and wobbles a little from side to
;   side. When a flake reaches the ground it leaves a white dot
;   there, so the snow slowly piles up, and then it starts again
;   from the top of the sky.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run and watch the snow fall. Press Stop to end it.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * many turtles at once: TELL a list of turtle numbers
;   * EACH runs instructions for every turtle in turn
;   * SETSHAPE to make a turtle look like a star
;   * moving with SETXY instead of FORWARD
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Use 40 flakes instead of 20.
;   * Make the snow blow sideways by adding 2 to every x move.
;   * Give the ground a hill so the snow lands on a slope.
; ============================================================

; SCENERY draws a dark sky's ground and a little house.
to scenery
  setpencolor [60 70 90]
  setpensize 60
  penup setxy -400 -280 setheading 90 pendown forward 800
  ; the house
  penup setxy 150 -250 setheading 0
  filled [120 70 60] [repeat 2 [forward 90 right 90 forward 120 right 90]]
  penup setxy 140 -160
  filled [80 50 50] [setxy 270 -160 setxy 205 -110 setxy 140 -160]
  setpencolor [255 220 120] setpensize 26
  dot [210 -200]
end

; START.FLAKES puts every flake turtle somewhere in the sky.
to start.flakes
  tell :flakes
  setshape "star
  setpencolor 7
  penup
  each [setxy (random -390 390) (random 0 300)]
  showturtle
end

; FALL moves one flake a little way down. At the ground it drops a
; dot on the pile and goes back up to the top.
to fall
  setxy xcor + (random -2 2) ycor - (random 2 5)
  if ycor < -245 [
    setpensize 6
    dot pos
    setxy (random -390 390) 300
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [20 30 60]
scenery
make "flakes iseq 1 20
start.flakes
forever [
  each [fall]
  wait 2
]
